Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:10:03.24,Yui Ogura,Yui Ogura,0,0,0,,Ready, set... ProSeka AfterTalk: With You Edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.20,Rina Honnizumi,Rina Honnizumi,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:11.36,Rina Honnizumi,Rina Honnizumi,0,0,0,,I'm Yui Ogura, the voice of Minori Hanasato from Momojan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:14.92,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And I'm Rina Honnizumi, the voice of Shizuku Hinomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:15.68,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Glad to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:17.08,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Glad to be here.
Comment: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:25.70,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Fan Letter Corner ===
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:25.70,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,ProSeka AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event\Nwhile reading the letters you've sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:33.32,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,This time is the "With You" edition. Did everyone enjoy the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.52,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What did you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:35.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how they felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.21,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, everyone in the comments is saying "Good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:36.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:38.80,2,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:39.60,2,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:42.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:44.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Hon-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:45.16,2,host,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, Hon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:46.68,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It's Hon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.50,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Someone said, "The story made me cry."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:56.76,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone has their own thoughts,\Nand the two of us will be diving deep into them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:51.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.72,2,host,0,0,0,,There were some really emotionally stirring scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:04.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It felt like a different world than usual, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:04.89,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:07.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was such a fresh story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:07.84,2,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.12,2,host,0,0,0,,Let's dig deeper into it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:10.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's.
Comment: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:14.86,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:14.86,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And starting in April... oh, wait, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Um, this time... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:18.82,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.81,2,host,0,0,0,,This time is the second round of World Link events.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:22.50,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.80,2,host,0,0,0,,It really was the second round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:24.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:29.80,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Let's talk later about how the atmosphere is different from the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.52,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you all for sending in so many of your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:33.92,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:34.68,2,host,0,0,0,,There are so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.13,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.36,0:11:46.16,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Also, ProSeka AfterTalk got a mini-renewal in April,\Nand we've been collecting fan letters via the official Discord and email.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:48.80,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much for the letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.44,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:54.60,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We'll be reading some of them during the show, so please look forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:54.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:55.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:56.35,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:12:04.20,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Also, please post your thoughts on the event and this stream using the ProSeka AfterTalk hashtag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:08.12,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We can see the YouTube chat here too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:11.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We'll be picking out comments that catch our eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.20,2,host,0,0,0,,We'll definitely be reading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.68,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:15.20,2,host,0,0,0,,Keep them coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:17.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,With just the two of us, it feels kind of fluffy and airy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:18.96,2,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, we are the airhead duo, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:23.56,2,host,0,0,0,,Wait, are we the airhead duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:24.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,At least within Momojan.
Comment: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.12,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.12,2,host,0,0,0,,So, oh, that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:27.83,2,host,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:31.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We're the most reliable ones here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.86,0:12:31.36,2,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.25,2,host,0,0,0,,Are you sure? The most?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:41.24,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,let's get right into talking about the story for this AfterTalk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.72,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What did everyone think of the story this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:45.09,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.04,2,host,0,0,0,,They're calling us the "Airhead Duo."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:48.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The "Airhead Duo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:52.88,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're calling us the "Fluffy Duo" too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:52.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The "Fluffy Duo," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.20,0:12:59.68,2,host,0,0,0,,First,\Nlet's look back at the story by reading some of the messages we received about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:00.25,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:04.64,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,This one is from Miso Nikomi Udon-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:05.25,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:08.84,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.52,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Good evening, Ogura-san and Honnizumi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:12.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:12.57,2,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:20.46,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I really love Minori-chan's words: 'Even if today wasn't a good day, tomorrow surely will be.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:28.76,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Momojan is truly radiant on stage, standing there with that unchanging desire to deliver hope even in this story."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.36,0:13:39.98,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The scene where a fan tells a worried Minori-chan how much she was shining at the handshake event felt like the exact moment that hope was delivered."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:43.12,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'll keep supporting the four of you in everything you do."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:44.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:45.88,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:55.04,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Someone mentioned in the comments earlier how Minori's "protagonist energy" was really shining through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:14:01.06,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,In that handshake event scene, Minori-chan was working so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:09.96,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and then a fan told her directly\Nthat seeing her effort made them want to support her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:10.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Comment: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:20.32,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:20.32,2,host,0,0,0,,Watching that person, I felt like Minori's radiance really reached them,\Nand that made me so happy just watching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.15,0:14:15.65,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:18.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:20.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:30.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It felt like she was finally rewarded.\NMinori's best qualities really stood out in this story,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:35.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and it felt so much like a classic Momojan story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:24.25,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:30.31,2,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:36.13,2,host,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:37.56,2,host,0,0,0,,That was especially true for Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:41.48,2,host,0,0,0,,It makes you want to cheer for her, like she's carrying everyone's hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:40.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope everyone was able to feel her charm too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:45.25,2,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.68,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you, Miso Nikomi Udon-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.58,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Let's introduce another letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:51.43,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.20,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello, Ogura-san and Honnizumi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:53.76,2,host,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:54.34,2,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:54.93,2,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:58.99,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The way Minori and Haruka met was so cute."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:14:59.58,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:06.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Finding out Haruka was the volunteer leader made for another surprising encounter in World Link, which was great."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:11.96,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The way they give each other hope is so cute and precious, I'll keep cheering them both on!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:12.35,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:20.78,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"When you two feel anxious or down in your work or daily lives, how do you overcome it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.78,0:15:26.24,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"If you have any secrets for feeling like you can do your best again tomorrow, please let us know," they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:30.84,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Do you ever feel anxious or get down?
Comment: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:30.17,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:30.17,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.36,2,host,0,0,0,,Wait, I do have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:33.16,2,host,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't think I have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:44.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I have them too, but how should I put it...\NWhether we're working together or all of Momojan is out for a meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:49.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I always feel so at ease because Yui-chan is so consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:50.52,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm a source of healing."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:52.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like, when we're in "work mode,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:58.88,2,host,0,0,0,,especially when we were together for the Momojan Thanksgiving event...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We're pretty much always on stage together, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:02.44,2,host,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:02.94,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:09.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For us, being in the wings right before going on is\Nwhen the nerves peak, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.21,2,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:10.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like, "It's starting!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:11.17,2,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,In those moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:17.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,looking at Yui-chan's back makes me feel like I can really count on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:19.20,2,host,0,0,0,,Looking at my back...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I really felt that from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:30.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,so I realized I haven't actually seen you get anxious or depressed very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:22.84,2,host,0,0,0,,Aw, that makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:28.29,2,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:30.95,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure all sorts of things happen between the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:34.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Of course they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:36.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But it just made me curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:37.80,2,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.20,2,host,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:39.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Because you're just so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.68,2,host,0,0,0,,I guess I try to be reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:43.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You really are.
Comment: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:44.78,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:44.78,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:47.04,2,host,0,0,0,,But I think I have a switch that flips when I'm on-site.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, so you really do have a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:49.12,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:53.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm actually the type to get pretty depressed when I'm at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:52.67,2,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:57.96,2,host,0,0,0,,So when you get home, you flip the switch off and just... collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:56.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:05.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I do get down, but fortunately, even if something bad happens,\NI tend to forget it pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:06.55,2,host,0,0,0,,That's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:07.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.12,0:17:08.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Once I sleep, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:09.40,2,host,0,0,0,,Because you forget everything once you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That really is the best way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.40,2,host,0,0,0,,That's why I try to get plenty of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:17.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I eat something delicious, sleep a lot,\Nand after a little while, I've already forgotten about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:20.40,2,host,0,0,0,,You're invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.01,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:21.64,2,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.64,2,host,0,0,0,,Eating and sleeping a lot is key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:27.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So, maybe putting in the effort to forget is also necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:28.88,2,host,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:34.48,2,host,0,0,0,,That mindset of consciously deciding to set something aside and move on is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:34.89,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:37.00,2,host,0,0,0,,I'll try to follow your lead on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:37.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:45.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, you're always so bright and cheerful on-site,\Nand that really helps everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since I'm the type who tends to get really serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.44,2,host,0,0,0,,When Yui-chan is really focused...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:49.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Comment: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:53.40,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:53.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When I hear Hon-chan's soft voice, I'm like, "Wow."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:55.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's so calming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:56.05,2,host,0,0,0,,It's healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:57.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel healed in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:04.24,2,host,0,0,0,,I used to worry that if I talked to you while you were focused,\Nlike telling you there was good food in the hall, I'd be bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:05.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Not at all, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's actually very healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:07.04,2,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:08.08,2,host,0,0,0,,Reporting on the catering...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.04,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Hon-chan is a real mood maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:10.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:10.79,2,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, do you have moments like that too, Hon-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So you do have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:13.84,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:20.54,2,host,0,0,0,,Just like Yui-chan said earlier, when I get home and I'm all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, so you do have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:21.36,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.04,2,host,0,0,0,,When no one is watching...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:25.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.12,2,host,0,0,0,,I start thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:36.36,2,host,0,0,0,,"Why couldn't I do it like that then?" or "I could've done this better," and I end up feeling really frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.83,0:18:35.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:37.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Regret can be powerful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:48.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even if it's something I can't control,\NI still feel frustrated or a bit down, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.19,0:18:40.69,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:46.97,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:48.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:55.32,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,In those moments, I let my cat comfort me. It's so healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:53.79,2,host,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Comment: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:57.60,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:57.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, like touching their paw pads?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:19:04.90,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, paw pads are so squishy. I huff them, pet them...\NOh, and Sally-chan—that's her name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:00.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:11.08,2,host,0,0,0,,Sally-chan's presence is huge for me. Other than that, I just eat and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, those things are really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:13.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Eating and sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:15.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You're doing great just by eating and sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:17.88,2,host,0,0,0,,And I go for walks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I love going for walks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:23.84,2,host,0,0,0,,It's so incredibly refreshing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.00,2,host,0,0,0,,I have a favorite path I take,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:30.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and I'll walk it empty-handed, without even bringing my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.99,0:19:30.49,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:37.40,2,host,0,0,0,,When I'm just looking straight ahead, breathing in the air and walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:40.44,2,host,0,0,0,,it really makes me feel like, "Ah, I'm actually breathing."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:40.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:45.68,2,host,0,0,0,,It's not exactly like a weight off my shoulders,\Nbut I feel like, "Okay, I'm just Rina Honnizumi right now."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:48.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like you're getting in touch with nature. I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.23,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:57.73,2,host,0,0,0,,It feels like time spent living as a human being.\NIt's important to stand tall as "Rina Honnizumi" like I am now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:20:01.72,2,host,0,0,0,,but I try to make sure I have time to switch off too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:58.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:02.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.60,2,host,0,0,0,,We actually have quite a lot in common,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.04,2,host,0,0,0,,now that we're talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:09.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It looks like everyone in the chat is agreeing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:10.19,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Refreshing, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:13.68,2,host,0,0,0,,Cats are so healing.
Comment: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.69,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It seems like a lot of people can relate to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:17.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:18.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:23.38,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Go for a walk, eat, sleep, and just forget... forget the bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:20.11,2,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:24.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:24.29,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:24.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:28.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It happens in daily life, but let's try to find ways to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:28.87,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.08,2,host,0,0,0,,For both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.15,0:20:30.65,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:31.26,2,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:31.92,2,host,0,0,0,,It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That was a message from Pochi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.20,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:38.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Now, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I guess it's time to move on to the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:42.21,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:43.62,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:43.62,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,From here,
Comment: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:49.16,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:49.16,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,each of us in the cast has picked out a scene we personally want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:50.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we each chose our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:51.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:51.61,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:55.08,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy seeing which scenes the four of us picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:55.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:21:01.32,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,First, I'd like you to take a look at the scene I picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:02.20,2,host,0,0,0,,I wonder which one it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:05.62,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Well, here is the scene I chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:06.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:10.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.60,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It's from the second half of Haruka's side story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:14.01,2,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:14.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.76,2,host,0,0,0,,When did she get so good at... Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:22.40,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the scene where she goes to volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:24.60,2,host,0,0,0,,With the kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.72,3,host,0,0,0,,And that's it! The white team wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.11,0:21:30.61,4,host,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:31.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:35.20,2,host,0,0,0,,The interactions with the kids were really nice, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's just glowing, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:40.44,2,host,0,0,0,,Also, maybe it was at the end of the first half...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan invited her to play dodgeball,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:44.17,2,host,0,0,0,,and the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:49.36,2,host,0,0,0,,where she noticed Minori-chan's distress and asked what was wrong was really memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.77,0:21:51.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:54.52,2,host,0,0,0,,I was really curious about how good it was, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:53.67,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:22:00.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She told Miyuki-chan the T-shirt she was wearing was a masterpiece and sang a song for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:01.21,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Comment: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:05.04,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.32,0:22:05.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The way she cheers up Minori-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:05.93,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.92,0:22:07.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.73,0:22:08.23,2,host,0,0,0,,Mhm, mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:09.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:11.48,2,host,0,0,0,,Haruka-chan is really watching her closely, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:12.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:13.40,2,host,0,0,0,,It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:18.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:19.56,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:21.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's so heartwar—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:23.92,2,host,0,0,0,,You know, she looks like such a big sister here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:24.64,2,host,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:25.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:29.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When you see her hanging out with the elementary school kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.48,2,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.72,2,host,0,0,0,,I was thinking about what great big sisters they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was probably really healing for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:38.12,2,host,0,0,0,,I'd want to be surrounded by seniors like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:40.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It looks that way, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:43.60,2,host,0,0,0,,Haruka-chan is very much "Kiritani-san" here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:44.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,At this point in the story, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:45.54,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:51.20,2,host,0,0,0,,She doesn't just let them join the dodgeball game,\Nshe teaches them how to enjoy it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:48.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Kiritani-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:58.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Seeing them interact at this distance is just so healing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.51,0:22:59.01,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:22:59.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:03.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's a bit complicated, but even while thinking it's difficult...
Comment: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.40,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:05.40,2,host,0,0,0,,But it's different now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:06.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was only for a little bit, so I had to try and remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:08.52,2,host,0,0,0,,Oh, don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:13.28,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I even said that the process of remembering felt like starting from zero again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:14.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was fun, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:16.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was like meeting everyone for the first time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:21.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It felt a bit like a time loop, so it was actually quite refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:19.24,2,host,0,0,0,,Since you gave me a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.22,2,host,0,0,0,,Wait, this isn't AfterTalk—I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:25.04,2,host,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.04,0:23:27.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's something unique to World Link.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:28.40,2,host,0,0,0,,No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:32.60,4,host,0,0,0,,Compared to Kiritani-san, I feel like I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:32.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:40.92,4,host,0,0,0,,But Haruka-chan once told me that even\Nif today isn't a good day, tomorrow might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:42.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's so encouraging, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.04,0:23:45.00,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,So even when I'm feeling down, I can keep doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.32,0:23:50.00,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,You can really feel that Haruka-chan has always been by Minori-chan's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.89,0:23:50.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.67,0:23:51.17,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,For me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:57.80,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Haruka-chan has always given me so much hope, both back then and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:23:59.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That really hits home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:00.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Hearing something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.72,0:24:06.36,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'll do my best so that one day, I can be an idol who delivers hope to someone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:13.56,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Minori's power to move people's hearts is truly amazing.\NIt reaches you so directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:21.20,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,What I did before, and the fact that I saddened so many fans...\Nthat's something that can never be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.93,0:24:23.43,4,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:28.72,4,host,0,0,0,,There was hope that reached people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.12,0:24:30.18,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Comment: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.28,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.18,0:24:31.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:35.52,4,host,0,0,0,,I want to be strong enough to keep pushing someone forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.24,0:24:36.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:38.36,4,host,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:43.44,4,host,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:44.15,4,host,0,0,0,,thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:45.76,4,host,0,0,0,,Hanasato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.41,0:24:47.91,4,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:50.20,4,host,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:51.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:52.92,2,host,0,0,0,,She's so unaware of it, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:53.80,2,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.65,0:24:55.15,4,host,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.93,0:24:55.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:25:00.20,2,host,0,0,0,,It's like she was given the hope to do her best tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.35,0:24:58.85,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.19,0:25:00.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:01.43,4,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.68,0:25:03.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It feels like these are her true, honest words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:11.48,4,host,0,0,0,,If you're okay with my straightforward, honest singing,\Nthen I'd like you to just call me Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.51,0:25:12.01,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.44,2,host,0,0,0,,They're really closing the distance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.96,0:25:16.08,4,host,0,0,0,,You don't need to use polite speech either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.32,0:25:20.00,4,host,0,0,0,,Can I call you Minori, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.01,0:25:22.51,5,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.05,0:25:23.55,5,host,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.43,0:25:24.93,5,host,0,0,0,,yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:26.16,4,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Wait, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:26.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:28.52,4,host,0,0,0,,I said, you don't need to be so formal.
Comment: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:31.26,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:31.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I remember this part so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.26,0:25:32.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's not "but."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.46,0:25:33.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's "and."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This part was difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.60,0:25:40.36,2,host,0,0,0,,I was really grateful that the script was written like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:41.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was written so tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.48,0:25:42.00,2,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was very conscious of the punctuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.88,0:25:45.96,2,host,0,0,0,,"I'll look for what I can do."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:47.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's not "but."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.72,0:25:48.84,2,host,0,0,0,,"I couldn't make it as an idol, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:49.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So cute, so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.64,0:25:53.80,4,host,0,0,0,,"So that this time, I can deliver plenty of hope."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:56.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Look at them, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.85,0:25:55.35,2,host,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.72,0:25:58.84,2,host,0,0,0,,Everyone, look at this face...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.96,0:25:59.96,4,host,0,0,0,,"Are you okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.76,0:26:04.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,These two are just so wholesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.51,0:26:02.01,2,host,0,0,0,,So wholesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.39,0:26:04.89,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.93,0:26:05.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's "and."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.88,0:26:06.48,2,host,0,0,0,,She's worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.89,0:26:07.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.51,0:26:08.13,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.89,0:26:09.39,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.32,0:26:10.96,2,host,0,0,0,,She says "and."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.08,0:26:13.44,4,host,0,0,0,,"Somehow, I feel like I've gained some energy."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.23,0:26:14.73,4,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:16.60,4,host,0,0,0,,"Let's keep moving forward."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.83,0:26:17.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:19.20,4,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:19.20,4,host,0,0,0,,Keeping these feelings in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:23.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:23.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:25.80,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:33.68,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I really loved how Minori's words resonated so deeply here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.61,0:26:32.11,2,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:35.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.96,0:26:37.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I started talking before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:39.12,2,host,0,0,0,,Let's talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.28,0:26:50.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,As I was saying, Minori's casual, honest,\Nand pure words really reached Haruka's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:27:06.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It encouraged her and helped her regain her confidence.\NI think the relationship between these two was beautifully portrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.47,0:27:05.97,2,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:06.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.94,0:27:14.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was a bit bittersweet, but also moving,\Nwarm, and had that "dayo" charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:16.92,2,host,0,0,0,,You can't leave out the "dayo."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:23.20,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It was a wonderful episode packed with so many different elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:27.33,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It really was a story that captured the best of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.59,0:27:26.09,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.33,0:27:27.94,2,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:29.40,2,host,0,0,0,,What did you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.04,0:27:31.24,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.24,0:27:33.28,2,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying Minori is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.25,0:27:36.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Dayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.71,0:27:37.21,2,host,0,0,0,,Dayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.36,0:27:38.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The "dayo" is the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.52,0:27:39.44,2,host,0,0,0,,Some people are even writing "dayo" in the chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.21,0:27:40.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:43.40,2,host,0,0,0,,Please, listen to that "dayo" over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:44.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? Let's all start using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.81,0:27:45.31,2,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:48.76,2,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Comment: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.24,2,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.24,2,host,0,0,0,,All right, next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:56.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The next scene I've chosen is from the second half of Shizuku's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:57.60,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Let's watch it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:57.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:01.36,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:03.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:09.92,2,host,0,0,0,,She's sitting on a bench under a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:11.64,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,She's going to eat lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:12.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:14.76,2,host,0,0,0,,I sent her our location, so she should be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.24,0:28:16.80,3,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.20,0:28:20.52,3,host,0,0,0,,It's Minori Hanasato.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.96,0:28:22.72,3,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:29.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I have to be careful not to let Minori Hanasato down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:30.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.36,0:28:35.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I actually struggled a bit to bring out that sense of awkwardness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.85,0:28:36.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:38.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.59,0:28:39.09,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, it did?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.20,0:28:39.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.89,0:28:40.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:41.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And then there's this thumping sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.23,0:28:43.73,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.44,0:28:46.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was even written in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.85,0:28:47.35,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The speed of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:50.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It said, "Minori comes running over with heavy footsteps."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:52.84,2,host,0,0,0,,You're not late at all, I only just messaged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.63,0:28:54.13,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:56.40,2,host,0,0,0,,It looks like she really rushed to get here.
Comment: 0,0:28:57.51,0:28:58.24,3,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.51,0:28:58.24,3,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:29:01.56,3,host,0,0,0,,I was really looking forward to eating together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.65,0:29:02.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.99,0:29:02.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.21,0:29:02.77,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.45,0:29:04.18,3,host,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.18,0:29:05.06,3,host,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.06,0:29:05.71,3,host,0,0,0,,you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.16,0:29:10.04,2,host,0,0,0,,A special guest...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:11.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's way too special!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.31,0:29:11.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Who did you invite?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.51,0:29:13.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.52,0:29:14.32,3,host,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:15.64,3,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.32,0:29:17.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:17.95,3,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:19.21,3,host,0,0,0,,She's radiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.48,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's got such an aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.61,0:29:21.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:23.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:26.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even the kids around her are glowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:26.70,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.60,0:29:30.28,4,host,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for intruding so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.56,0:29:33.80,4,host,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I joined you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.20,0:29:36.96,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,O-O-O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.80,0:29:40.00,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,In fact, I'll move over to make room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.84,0:29:43.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,In the script, it says...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:44.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:46.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You're the star of the show today!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:47.91,3,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:50.52,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.92,0:29:50.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.92,0:29:52.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan remembers it, doesn't she? I remember this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:55.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I occasionally do that counting thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:58.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I do it pretty frequently too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:57.71,3,host,0,0,0,,It kind of bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.81,0:29:59.31,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.24,0:30:01.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So you were actually counting to twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.99,0:30:00.49,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Well, I tried to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.36,0:30:02.18,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I was counting, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.18,0:30:06.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I actually said it right, but I was conscious of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:08.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You can really feel Minori-chan's flustered energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.19,0:30:09.69,3,host,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.72,0:30:12.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The numbers were actually written in the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.45,0:30:12.95,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.09,0:30:13.59,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Like the number five and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:16.13,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.08,0:30:17.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.69,0:30:18.23,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:18.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They're written in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.80,0:30:20.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,There are quite a few of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:22.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.16,0:30:27.36,2,host,0,0,0,,Seeing Minori dancing so hard made me want to do my best too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:32.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the emotion from when Minori-chan performed live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.39,0:30:32.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:33.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:33.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.96,0:30:36.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Something like this doesn't happen very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:38.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's such a luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.16,0:30:40.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.44,0:30:41.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It only happens every once in a while.
Comment: 0,0:30:41.19,0:30:41.69,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.19,0:30:41.69,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.48,0:30:44.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But this is where she shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:45.61,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:46.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:47.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's like her power, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.63,0:30:48.13,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.56,0:30:49.28,3,host,0,0,0,,It's quite rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:54.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Minori was supposed to have no luck at all,\Nbut after overcoming that, such good fortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.84,0:30:56.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Such good fortune was waiting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:00.20,3,host,0,0,0,,Nobody ever praises me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.64,0:31:03.20,2,host,0,0,0,,Praising you once in a while is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.12,0:31:05.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku and Airi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.99,0:31:05.49,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.76,0:31:07.64,3,host,0,0,0,,Those two are really close, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.64,0:31:09.60,3,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.76,0:31:13.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Reading about these two again, I thought it was really lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.00,0:31:16.96,3,host,0,0,0,,Shiho-chan is Shizuku Hinomori's younger sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.31,0:31:17.81,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.61,0:31:18.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.32,0:31:19.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's an exquisite...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.16,0:31:19.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exquisite...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:20.72,3,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.52,0:31:23.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We're both kind of airheads...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.48,0:31:24.68,3,host,0,0,0,,Are you friends with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.16,0:31:25.84,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We're both a bit soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.99,0:31:26.49,3,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.48,0:31:28.40,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I rely on her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:29.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She looks out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.72,0:31:31.40,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,She's so reliable and leads the way.
Comment: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:31.91,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:31.91,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.48,0:31:34.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They have such a great balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.40,3,host,0,0,0,,"Thank you for being friends with my little sister,"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:38.80,3,host,0,0,0,,"Minori-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.09,0:31:40.59,3,host,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.54,0:31:42.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:42.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Shi-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:45.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This part was really memorable, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.96,0:31:47.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Since they're classmates, Minori-chan says,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:51.68,3,host,0,0,0,,"We talk about things like homework and things that made us happy."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.75,0:31:52.25,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.33,0:31:54.03,3,host,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.96,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"And we also talk about bunnies a lot."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:31:59.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's just too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.44,0:32:01.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This part was really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.42,0:32:03.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even though they're siblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.28,0:32:05.60,3,host,0,0,0,,I didn't know she had that side to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:09.52,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Back in first grade, Shiho-chan helped take care of them for a bit."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.68,0:32:12.28,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I actually felt a little jealous watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:13.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.19,0:32:13.86,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Watching it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.86,0:32:16.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Wait, I don't know that side of Shi-chan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.20,0:32:18.76,3,host,0,0,0,,Shi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:21.12,3,host,0,0,0,,Was she the "Shi-Queen"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.08,0:32:22.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Like, "You should've told me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:24.12,3,host,0,0,0,,I was watching it so intently.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:26.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wait, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.16,0:32:28.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I have to keep going as Minori and Shizuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:29.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,In our activities...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.24,0:32:31.76,2,host,0,0,0,,"You don't just tell your family every little thing, do you?"
Comment: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:34.32,3,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:34.32,3,host,0,0,0,,That might be true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:35.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She looks a little shocked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.24,0:32:36.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:45.20,3,host,0,0,0,,But since Shi-chan loves cute animals, this job is perfect for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:45.95,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.95,0:32:46.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.88,0:32:49.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:51.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They're calling her the "Sea Queen" because of her name, Shi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.80,0:32:52.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.65,0:32:53.15,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.23,0:32:54.73,3,host,0,0,0,,She's the Sea Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:55.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Is that what it was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.92,0:32:58.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing how she looks at each one's personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:32:59.84,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's our Shi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.87,0:33:00.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Shi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:07.60,3,host,0,0,0,,Shiho-chan always seems cool, but she's actually very caring and kind, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.35,0:33:08.85,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:10.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.16,0:33:10.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I love that gap in her personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.87,0:33:11.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:18.72,3,host,0,0,0,,The other day, when I got lost at the station,\Nshe went out of her way to come pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:20.14,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.93,0:33:20.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.14,0:33:23.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku's best qualities are starting to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.93,0:33:23.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,...really show through.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:25.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.83,0:33:25.33,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.08,0:33:26.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.73,0:33:27.23,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.17,0:33:28.67,3,host,0,0,0,,*Sigh*
Comment: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:31.40,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:31.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It would have been totally fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.87,0:33:32.37,3,host,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.68,0:33:33.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? From an outsider's perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:35.84,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,you'd think it was totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.08,0:33:37.32,3,host,0,0,0,,I let my guard down for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.56,0:33:38.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But I guess that's not allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.84,0:33:39.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.35,0:33:39.85,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.77,0:33:40.27,3,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.96,0:33:42.72,3,host,0,0,0,,I'm not lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:44.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's not lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.53,0:33:46.25,3,host,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.25,0:33:51.00,3,host,0,0,0,,Even looking at the map, I no longer know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.79,0:33:49.29,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:53.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I love the way she said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.00,0:33:54.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Don't say it like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.88,0:33:55.76,3,host,0,0,0,,What else am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.28,0:33:58.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She sounds so serious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.40,0:34:05.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The stage directions in the script actually said "Hinomori-senpai" here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.05,0:34:05.55,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.96,0:34:06.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It felt like there was a lot of meaning behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.39,0:34:08.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.20,0:34:09.80,3,host,0,0,0,,Whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:11.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That was a lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.01,0:34:12.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"Whatever shall I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:17.08,3,host,0,0,0,,She can be a bit of an airhead sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.68,0:34:18.24,3,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:20.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan, you're shining too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.61,0:34:21.11,3,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:22.72,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:22.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.83,0:34:23.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.71,0:34:24.37,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I love the gap in her personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.11,0:34:24.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.37,0:34:25.03,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The gap is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.95,0:34:25.45,3,host,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:26.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Gaps are just the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.52,0:34:28.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I love them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.32,0:34:30.00,2,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:32.12,2,host,0,0,0,,She's actually quite airheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.84,0:34:40.00,2,host,0,0,0,,So she can be a handful sometimes, but somehow it ends up being really soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.33,0:34:36.83,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:40.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.09,0:34:41.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.80,0:34:43.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's what she says about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.40,0:34:44.16,3,host,0,0,0,,They're standing a bit apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.24,0:34:51.72,3,host,0,0,0,,"The Shizuku-chan I see on TV and in magazines is beautiful and cool, so I always thought she was out of reach."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.69,0:34:52.19,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.68,0:35:00.76,3,host,0,0,0,,"But when Hinomori-senpai talks about Shiho-chan, she has such a gentle look on her face that it makes me feel all warm inside."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.08,0:35:03.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Those are Minori's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.05,0:35:03.55,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really hits home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.84,0:35:05.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really sinks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.37,0:35:05.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,What a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.32,0:35:07.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She really is such a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.36,0:35:10.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's just too precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.96,0:35:11.60,3,host,0,0,0,,"Minori-chan..."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.53,0:35:13.03,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,*Sigh*
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.03,0:35:13.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,*Sigh*
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:18.00,3,host,0,0,0,,"I can't believe you'd say that to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.03,0:35:18.53,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Comment: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:24.52,3,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:24.52,3,host,0,0,0,,"I thought that being my true self would only disappoint everyone around me."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.41,0:35:24.91,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:28.56,3,host,0,0,0,,"But I see there are people who will accept me just as I am."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:26.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.72,0:35:33.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,if we held a "Words of Wisdom from Minori" session,\Ndon't you think a ton of people would feel encouraged?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:35.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd actually want to go to that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.44,0:35:36.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I want to soak it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.09,0:35:37.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:38.59,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Those words...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.68,0:35:39.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I really want her to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.80,0:35:41.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'd want her to listen to my problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.77,0:35:42.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.36,0:35:43.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It would be so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.53,0:35:44.03,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.40,0:35:46.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It would make your heart feel so much lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:48.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"Because I want to be everyone's Shizuku Hinomori."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.20,0:35:48.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.77,0:35:49.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:50.68,3,host,0,0,0,,"Is that so?"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.12,0:35:52.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really has that much power, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.33,0:35:52.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.00,0:35:55.00,3,host,0,0,0,,"I think that's very lovely."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.37,0:35:55.87,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.00,0:35:58.28,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"If that's what you say, Senpai, then I understand."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.52,0:35:59.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's so kind here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.64,0:36:01.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I just thought, "What a good girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.97,0:36:02.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:03.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan is...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.77,0:36:04.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.75,0:36:05.25,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Truly.
Comment: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:06.27,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:06.27,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.51,0:36:07.01,3,host,0,0,0,,Um, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:12.92,3,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to see this side of you every now and then, Hinomori-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.71,0:36:14.21,3,host,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.32,0:36:17.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,If someone said that to me, I'd just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.15,0:36:18.65,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.16,0:36:22.60,3,host,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.72,0:36:23.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Clinic Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.11,0:36:25.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's what they're calling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:26.11,3,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.12,0:36:30.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Clinic Minori is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:30.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.72,0:36:37.20,3,host,0,0,0,,I always thought I had to be the person everyone expected me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.68,0:36:38.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's always so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.51,0:36:39.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.16,0:36:41.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.36,0:36:42.08,3,host,0,0,0,,But in that place...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:47.56,3,host,0,0,0,,Maybe it's okay for me to relax a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:48.23,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.20,0:36:53.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are people who will accept Shizuku-chan just as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:54.31,3,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:02.48,3,host,0,0,0,,Was I just hearing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.29,0:37:03.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.39,0:37:05.89,3,host,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.79,0:37:07.29,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.48,0:37:09.36,3,host,0,0,0,,Hey, Minori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.48,0:37:14.04,3,host,0,0,0,,If you'd like, could we have a meal together again?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.24,0:37:18.44,3,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to get to know more about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.92,0:37:20.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This is kind of embarrassing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.16,0:37:22.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm starting to feel a bit shy now.
Comment: 0,0:37:22.25,0:37:22.75,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.25,0:37:22.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.28,0:37:24.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,watching them makes us...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.15,0:37:24.65,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,...so happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.40,0:37:26.96,3,host,0,0,0,,"I'll go and think of a self-introduction too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.64,0:37:28.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,A self-introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.01,0:37:29.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.75,0:37:30.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's so healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.52,0:37:40.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.99,0:37:40.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.24,0:37:43.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That was the second half of Shizuku Hinomori's scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:51.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I had a hard time choosing because there were so many good scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.88,0:37:49.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.61,0:37:52.11,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.95,0:37:52.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:38:00.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Well, throughout the whole story,\NMinori Hanasato was just such a light, such a sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.49,0:37:55.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.48,0:37:59.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:01.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.13,0:38:01.63,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.08,0:38:10.14,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She becomes a source of emotional support for everyone,\Neven in this world where they aren't active as Momojan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.69,0:38:05.19,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.14,0:38:22.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I felt like, "Ah, she really is the sun." She's a constant presence,\Nand this power Minori has just pulls everyone in a good direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.04,0:38:12.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.23,0:38:16.73,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.52,0:38:23.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She has a certain gravity, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:24.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She draws everyone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.92,0:38:29.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And more than that, she kind of saves your heart, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.92,0:38:30.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She lifts you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.91,0:38:31.41,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Comment: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:39.12,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:39.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Shizuku mentioned that she felt like she could breathe easier,\Nand well...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:40.42,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:48.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Like we were talking about earlier, when you're working,\Nit's important to have those moments where you're focused,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.09,0:38:55.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,but also spaces where you can just relax and breathe.\NIt made me feel grateful to Minori all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:55.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.84,0:38:58.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I get it. It really makes you want to thank Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.91,0:38:58.41,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:38:59.65,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.64,0:39:02.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for being Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.21,0:39:03.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for always smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.32,0:39:11.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it made me feel like I want to keep working with her,\Nwhich is why I chose this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.48,0:39:07.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the future too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.39,0:39:10.89,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.71,0:39:12.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:15.56,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,So, that's why I picked this scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.71,0:39:16.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.24,0:39:16.84,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.09,0:39:17.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.60,0:39:19.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone is showing their gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.00,0:39:21.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you to everyone for the thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:23.22,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.22,0:39:24.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,No, it's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.40,0:39:27.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I honestly want to build a shrine to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.52,0:39:29.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right? She was just so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.09,0:39:30.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.08,0:39:34.54,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,You know, when I first heard about this World Link story,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.54,0:39:40.14,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'd heard a little rumor from the staff\Nthat Momojan might be in for some trouble this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.14,0:39:50.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They actually told me a bit about it during the recording sessions,\Nso I was really anxious until I finally read the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.96,0:39:43.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.55,0:39:45.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.83,0:39:47.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:39:51.52,0:39:52.22,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.52,0:39:52.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.22,0:39:52.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It makes you feel anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:40:00.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Momojan has been through a lot,\Nand the unit's story has many raw, realistic depictions, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.96,0:40:06.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I wondered what would happen,\Nbut in the end, there's a sense of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:12.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Even if Minori isn't active as part of Momojan,\Nshe still saves them, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:05.67,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.72,0:40:16.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right. Personally, in the ending...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.83,0:40:17.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.32,0:40:18.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,In the ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:22.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,everyone gathers together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.29,0:40:22.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:28.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everyone helps out to make sure Minori passes her audition safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.69,0:40:24.19,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.32,0:40:30.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,With everyone's support, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.11,0:40:30.78,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.78,0:40:35.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,In that scene, they all somehow end up gathering on the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.12,0:40:35.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.96,0:40:41.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It just made me so happy to see them all together there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.24,0:40:39.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:42.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The rooftop is great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.11,0:40:42.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.64,0:40:43.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.87,0:40:44.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.44,0:40:47.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That part made me really happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.72,0:40:58.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad they wrote it that way.\NBecause we know the Momojan of today, it really hits home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.29,0:40:51.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.93,0:40:55.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.68,0:40:58.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.59,0:40:59.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.32,0:41:02.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It felt a little nostalgic in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.08,0:41:03.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Comment: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.60,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really felt like a return to their roots, or like a peak moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.80,0:41:11.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It felt like they came back to where they started,\Nand I really felt their bond again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.33,0:41:07.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.43,0:41:10.93,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.55,0:41:12.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.72,0:41:12.47,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.48,0:41:14.50,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's how it felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:15.32,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.44,0:41:16.20,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.28,0:41:17.48,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Comment: 0,0:41:18.80,0:41:22.20,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.80,0:41:22.20,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Now, let's take a look at the card illustrations for this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.80,0:41:24.12,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Oh, the cards! They were so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.06,0:41:24.56,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,They really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.56,0:41:25.52,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.52,0:41:30.96,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We actually received comments from the illustration team again,\Nwhich is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.24,0:41:32.32,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'd like to share those with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.39,0:41:32.89,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.24,0:41:33.83,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,They said,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.83,0:41:45.80,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Since this event takes place in a world where Momojan was never formed, we created these with the theme of 'a lonely tea party,' reflecting the loneliness and emptiness of each character's situation."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.89,0:41:46.39,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.52,0:41:57.00,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"First, for Minori, the trained art shows her dancing alone in the center of a hall, as if she's touching her memories of practicing with everyone."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.91,0:41:57.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:42:12.44,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"On the table of the empty tea party, we placed marigolds—which symbolize 'loneliness' and 'unchanging love'—in a position where they look like a dance partner, making it appear as if someone is there with her."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.52,0:42:14.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,We'll enlarge the images in a bit so we can see them better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.28,0:42:19.00,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Wow, everything is just so meticulously calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.35,0:42:20.02,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.02,0:42:23.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I didn't realize the theme even extended to the language of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.39,0:42:21.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.84,0:42:24.48,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.76,0:42:26.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I definitely felt a strong sense of isolation when I saw the art.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.59,0:42:27.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.28,0:42:28.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When I first saw the illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.12,0:42:30.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Hearing it put into words like this makes me go, "Oh..."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.84,0:42:32.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"So that's what it meant," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.03,0:42:32.53,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.64,0:42:33.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.81,0:42:34.31,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.96,0:42:45.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,"Next, for Haruka, we wanted to express how she still wants to deliver hope even after quitting ASUNARO. In the shadows, she's wearing her ASUNARO outfit..."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.13,0:42:45.63,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.68,0:42:55.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,"While she has a melancholy expression, she's leaning her body toward the light to show that she hasn't completely given up on delivering hope."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:59.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True,\NI feel like the boundary between light and shadow was very distinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.93,0:42:57.43,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:42:58.53,0:42:59.03,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:42:59.03,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:00.29,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.52,0:43:05.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,If you keep that in mind while looking at them,\Nit might change how you feel about the illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.86,0:43:06.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.36,0:43:07.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.09,0:43:07.83,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.44,0:43:09.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Next is Airi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.19,0:43:09.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.92,0:43:22.52,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"For Airi-chan, we contrasted the untrained art of her streaming happily while eating sweets with a trained version showing her unfulfilled feelings at a lonely tea party."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.43,0:43:22.93,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.16,0:43:30.00,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"By putting the untrained art in a bright room and the trained version in the shadows, we've made it a piece where the loneliness really stands out."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:31.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:32.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The light is completely gone from her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.68,0:43:35.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,We're looking at the trained version now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.77,0:43:34.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:37.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It feels quite fresh, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.08,0:43:38.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's rare to see Airi-chan like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.68,0:43:40.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's rare, but it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.22,0:43:40.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:42.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This side of Airi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.08,0:43:44.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,An expression like this really gets to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.76,0:43:46.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It hits hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.45,0:43:46.95,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.11,0:43:48.74,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.74,0:43:49.64,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:51.58,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And finally, Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.58,0:44:06.52,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"For Shizuku, we contrasted the perfect smile everyone expects from Shizuku Hinomori in the untrained art with a trained version of her lying on a table at an empty tea party with a helpless expression."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.53,0:44:07.03,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.16,0:44:16.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,You know, the untrained art appeared during the story too,\Nbut... how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.08,0:44:24.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's smiling as the 'perfect Shizuku Hinomori,' but the artistic skill required to express
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.28,0:44:33.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,that hint of loneliness and the pain of not being her true self in front of the camera is just...
Comment: 0,0:44:23.79,0:44:24.29,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.79,0:44:24.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.73,0:44:29.23,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:35.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.15,0:44:35.65,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.53,0:44:36.03,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.16,0:44:40.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really moves your heart, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:40.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It does, your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.84,0:44:50.02,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And since Momojan has always been so bright and sparkly as idols,\Nseeing this side of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.02,0:44:56.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's not exactly about being convincing,\Nbut it makes it resonate even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:57.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's that gap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.14,0:44:57.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.64,0:45:02.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'm actually more drawn to them when I see\Nthat they go through things like this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.83,0:45:03.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.37,0:45:03.87,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.96,0:45:05.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The stronger the light...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.22,0:45:05.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.72,0:45:10.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's like, "Oh, I see," and it feels very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:12.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It shows their human warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.39,0:45:12.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.88,0:45:15.62,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's really something, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.62,0:45:16.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And to this extent...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.52,0:45:17.22,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.22,0:45:18.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing every time,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:20.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but I was so moved this time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.96,0:45:21.76,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.96,0:45:22.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The power of the art is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:23.35,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.08,0:45:24.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.04,0:45:25.56,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.12,0:45:32.06,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Since we're on the topic,\Nlet's take a look at the illustrations together.
Comment: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:35.44,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.06,0:45:35.44,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll leave the controls to Hon-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:35.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.04,0:45:38.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Let's start with Minori's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.80,0:45:39.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.52,0:45:41.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,First off, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.52,0:45:47.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The way the light hits her is just so stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.32,0:45:48.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The spotlight is right on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.36,0:45:49.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.28,0:45:50.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And the marigolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.51,0:45:51.01,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.12,0:45:51.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,There are flowers here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.76,0:45:53.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,These flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.08,0:45:55.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They're like what we were saying earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.04,0:45:57.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's like they're dancing along with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:45:59.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They're expressing that through the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.32,0:46:01.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I can really see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.76,0:46:03.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? They're in the background too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.64,0:46:04.62,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And her posing...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.62,0:46:05.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.52,0:46:10.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, and the way the dust is dancing in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.48,0:46:11.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's so realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.34,0:46:11.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.84,0:46:13.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This really brings out
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.76,0:46:15.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,the sense of loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.52,0:46:17.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The balance of light and color...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.77,0:46:19.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.24,0:46:22.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everything about it adds so much character.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:23.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.80,0:46:25.48,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's such a wonderful piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.84,0:46:26.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Comment: 0,0:46:26.59,0:46:27.09,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.59,0:46:27.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.00,0:46:29.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,All right, let's take a look at the untrained art too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.92,0:46:34.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's nice to look at these again after reading everyone's comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.28,0:46:37.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You can really see all the fine details.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.72,0:46:40.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right? Isn't this scene just a bit too real?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.96,0:46:41.46,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.43,0:46:41.93,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.64,0:46:44.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's handing out flyers, and they're just like, "Oh, no thanks."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.80,0:46:47.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute, just take one already!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.97,0:46:48.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.16,0:46:50.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I can totally relate to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.76,0:46:51.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:53.40,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"But her eyes are still sparkling."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.88,0:46:54.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's right, even here...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.68,0:46:56.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan isn't giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.52,0:46:58.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"She's looking them straight in the eye as she hands them out."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.39,0:46:58.89,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"She's a total pop star."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.00,0:47:01.36,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Everyone, please take a flyer if you see Minori handing them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.96,0:47:04.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I'd take a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:05.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.78,0:47:06.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:08.04,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"That was the determined Minori-chan."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.72,0:47:10.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Next up is Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.33,0:47:10.83,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.85,0:47:11.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Haruka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.72,0:47:13.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The trained version...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.27,0:47:13.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.28,0:47:15.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yes, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.12,0:47:18.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Isn't the composition of this one just incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.96,0:47:19.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This one right here.
Comment: 0,0:47:19.83,0:47:20.33,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.83,0:47:20.33,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.04,0:47:21.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.68,0:47:24.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The way they used light and shadow here...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.76,0:47:26.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.52,0:47:27.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's so clearly...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.84,0:47:29.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,...and sharply divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.44,0:47:33.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The angle of the light coming through the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:40.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and that mannequin in the back left covered in cloth,\NI wonder if that's Asrun's costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.75,0:47:35.25,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.01,0:47:38.51,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.68,0:47:42.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.56,0:47:48.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Looking at it again after reading that comment, it really makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.67,0:47:44.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:48.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really comes across.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.76,0:47:49.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,There are new discoveries too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.20,0:47:51.30,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And it's just beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.30,0:47:54.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Even though she has this sort of vacant look,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.76,0:47:55.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,she's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.48,0:47:59.32,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This ephemeral Haruka-chan is so nice, isn't she? It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.03,0:47:58.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.19,0:47:59.90,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.90,0:48:06.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You can really see that feeling of not wanting to give up,\Neven in those vacant eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.96,0:48:09.24,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's expressed through the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.49,0:48:09.99,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.12,0:48:11.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.59,0:48:12.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.84,0:48:13.36,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.48,0:48:14.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The outfit is cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.36,0:48:15.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It is, isn't it? This outfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.92,0:48:17.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's so cute.
Comment: 0,0:48:17.12,0:48:17.84,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.12,0:48:17.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,A tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.84,0:48:18.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And, oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.08,0:48:19.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The untrained art.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.84,0:48:21.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This one is so cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.68,0:48:25.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:29.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It captures a slice of their everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.81,0:48:30.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.92,0:48:32.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It makes you wish this moment could last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.69,0:48:33.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.21,0:48:35.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It makes me want to say, "Thank you so much for this."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:40.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Thank you for showing us such a wonderful moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.08,0:48:42.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Minori looks so happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.76,0:48:43.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.72,0:48:46.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And look at the gentle way Haruka is gazing at Minori.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.03,0:48:46.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.20,0:48:51.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The casual outfits are really nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.99,0:48:50.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:52.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Tracksuits and T-shirts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.64,0:48:55.38,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It feels like they're working hard, but in a natural way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.38,0:48:55.91,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.28,0:48:57.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's holding a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.00,0:49:02.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe this is from when they were all playing dodgeball?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.17,0:49:02.67,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.93,0:49:03.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.01,0:49:04.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.51,0:49:06.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I want to protect these two and their smiles forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.24,0:49:10.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Next up is Airi Momoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.07,0:49:10.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.20,0:49:12.12,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Here is the trained version.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Comment: 0,0:49:14.12,0:49:16.44,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.12,0:49:16.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Man, this is just really, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.64,0:49:18.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:26.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I feel like this atmosphere is something only Airi could pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.72,0:49:28.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan is always so energetic, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.44,0:49:29.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.32,0:49:30.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And such a hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.19,0:49:30.69,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.76,0:49:35.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But it's also quite rare to see the whole screen
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.61,0:49:37.11,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.64,0:49:38.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,looking this dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.83,0:49:39.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.44,0:49:41.82,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I also really love these colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.82,0:49:49.16,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The pink of her outfit and hair acts as an accent color against those muted tones.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.31,0:49:42.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The tones, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.44,0:49:52.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, the color scheme is just exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.01,0:49:53.51,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.61,0:49:54.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.20,0:49:55.96,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The dark table and everything looks so stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.72,0:50:00.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It has this stillness, but there's also a bit of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.59,0:49:58.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.15,0:50:00.65,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.27,0:50:01.77,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.00,0:50:04.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It makes me want to give her a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.32,0:50:04.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.88,0:50:06.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The hats are adorable on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.84,0:50:09.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True, the details are slightly different for each of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.28,0:50:10.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The outfits are really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.48,0:50:13.64,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,This Airi-chan is wonderful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.55,0:50:14.05,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.08,0:50:18.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And... oh, look, how cute.
Comment: 0,0:50:18.08,0:50:20.00,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.08,0:50:20.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Eating donuts is so comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.72,0:50:21.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,This Airi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.84,0:50:22.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.56,0:50:23.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's even sticking her tongue out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.39,0:50:23.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.12,0:50:24.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,A wink and a blep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.08,0:50:26.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's a good blep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.12,0:50:26.87,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.87,0:50:28.76,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It makes me want to crash this...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.04,0:50:29.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.45,0:50:30.95,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,...party.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.08,0:50:31.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Her party outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.64,0:50:34.68,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The pose is cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.48,0:50:37.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Airi-chan really worked hard like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.08,0:50:38.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,In variety shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.04,0:50:41.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,These two are great together too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.12,0:50:41.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They're like siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.87,0:50:42.37,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.00,0:50:44.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Nanami-san pops up here and there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.71,0:50:45.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.44,0:50:49.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's been working with Momojan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.95,0:50:49.45,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.40,0:50:51.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope they can do something together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.88,0:50:52.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.55,0:50:53.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.28,0:50:54.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,A happy blep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.08,0:50:55.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,A happy blep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.72,0:50:59.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She said she practiced the angle of her tongue a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.64,0:51:02.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,If you look closely, it looks pretty realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:10.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,During Momojan events, I'm sure the people\Nwho write the stories have a lot of fun coming up with these details.
Comment: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:12.20,Yui Ogura,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:12.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right? You can already feel that vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.08,0:51:13.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, and next...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:15.00,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And here is Shizuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.64,0:51:18.12,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Wow, this one is also beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.44,0:51:21.92,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,There's something about Shizuku's beauty\Nthat makes it look like a painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.27,0:51:20.77,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.04,0:51:27.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,The fact\Nthat her face is intentionally in the shadows feels really meaningful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.48,0:51:26.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.11,0:51:28.61,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.56,0:51:32.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, the way the light isn't hitting her face is a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.15,0:51:33.65,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.12,0:51:40.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And the way she's lying on the table allows for so many deep interpretations.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.67,0:51:37.17,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.08,0:51:40.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.12,0:51:43.08,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And the fact that it's Shizuku doing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.37,0:51:42.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.68,0:51:44.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.11,0:51:44.61,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.48,0:51:46.52,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's just gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.68,0:51:47.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.27,0:51:47.77,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.56,0:51:49.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So ephemeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.25,0:51:49.75,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.56,0:51:51.84,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Everything about it is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.84,0:51:53.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's like a painting...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.76,0:51:54.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She's so photogenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.32,0:51:55.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,She really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.00,0:51:56.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's like she's showing off her skills as a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.48,0:51:58.00,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.08,0:51:59.72,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,She's beautiful.
Comment: 0,0:51:59.84,0:52:01.42,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.84,0:52:01.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's our Shizuku for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.42,0:52:03.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Her modeling skills just keep getting better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.73,0:52:04.23,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.00,0:52:06.40,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,And here is the untrained art.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.40,0:52:07.28,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.40,0:52:08.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This is just so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.72,0:52:10.66,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.66,0:52:11.56,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.56,0:52:16.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,You can really see how hard she's working, but also...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.31,0:52:14.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.12,0:52:18.64,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Her expression tells the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.16,0:52:21.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's cute, but also beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.16,0:52:23.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It has a certain fleeting quality, and it's definitely beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.93,0:52:22.43,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.71,0:52:24.21,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.17,0:52:25.67,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.56,0:52:28.16,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.48,0:52:33.88,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,But you can really feel that this is a different side of Shizuku
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.19,0:52:35.69,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,than the one in Momojan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.85,0:52:36.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.39,0:52:36.89,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.53,0:52:37.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.44,0:52:38.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I just want to see her smiling with all her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.87,0:52:39.37,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.28,0:52:46.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,But that fleeting look is so beautiful\Nthat it gives me mixed feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.92,0:52:44.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.00,0:52:48.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's complicated for us watching her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:49.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But that's good in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.76,0:52:50.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I end up thinking that's good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.99,0:52:51.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But I still want her to smile.
Comment: 0,0:52:51.71,0:52:52.43,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.71,0:52:52.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.61,0:52:53.35,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.35,0:52:54.09,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.99,0:52:55.49,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.72,0:52:57.00,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Right? It really is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.88,0:53:02.04,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,All right, that's all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.83,0:53:00.33,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.32,0:53:03.44,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,They're really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:03.95,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.00,0:53:06.60,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I feel like we got to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.04,0:53:08.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, a new side of Momojan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.39,0:53:09.04,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.04,0:53:10.92,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Like a new atmosphere, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.11,0:53:10.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.77,0:53:11.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.48,0:53:15.80,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I think their charm really came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.20,0:53:14.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Their appeal has definitely grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.96,0:53:18.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And they named the team "Rooftop."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.45,0:53:18.95,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.60,0:53:21.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Because the rooftop is where it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.04,0:53:23.84,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Yeah, they said they unanimously chose "Rooftop."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.96,0:53:25.00,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"We went with Rooftop," they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.85,0:53:25.35,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.11,0:53:26.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.56,0:53:29.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's wrap things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.07,0:53:28.57,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.12,0:53:30.12,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,That felt so short!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.21,0:53:30.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.74,0:53:31.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.88,0:53:32.87,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.87,0:53:38.78,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,this edition of ProSeka AfterTalk for the "Jump With You" event has come to an end.
Comment: 0,0:53:38.78,0:53:41.50,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.78,0:53:41.50,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Everyone watching the stream, what did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.50,0:53:44.48,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for all the excitement in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.60,0:53:46.20,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,It makes me so happy, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.41,0:53:46.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.04,0:53:49.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? They're smiling, but it's so bittersweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.63,0:53:50.13,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.72,0:53:51.88,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,I love that slightly somber feeling too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.32,0:53:55.82,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. Seeing Momojan with expressions like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.82,0:53:58.36,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It's actually pretty rare, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.67,0:53:58.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.60,0:54:02.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really makes you feel how amazing these four are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.72,0:54:03.34,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.19,0:54:03.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.34,0:54:03.95,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:05.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so glad they found each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.32,0:54:06.20,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.27,0:54:06.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:11.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It makes me realize all over again that Momojan is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.08,0:54:12.72,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,Oh, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.28,0:54:18.18,Yui Ogura,host,0,0,0,,It was like a reaffirmation for us too, of the team's strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.20,0:54:17.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.18,0:54:21.08,Yui Ogura,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I feel like we were really able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.36,0:54:22.16,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.72,0:54:25.04,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And with that, regarding this event...
